/target
.env
.env.test
llms.md
*.log
/data
# .claude/ is local-only EXCEPT rules/ — those carry load-bearing invariants that
# must travel with the repo (a fresh clone without them loses the landmine map).
.claude/*
!.claude/rules/
# Local code-knowledge-graph index. codegraph was retired 2026-06-29 in favour of
# codebase-memory-mcp; both write a repo-local store that is rebuilt on demand.
/.codebase-memory/
/.mcp.json
/meta.sqlite*
/meta_logs.sqlite*
tests/fixtures/functions/src-*/target/
tests/fixtures/functions/src-*/Cargo.lock

# Local-only working docs + audit scratch (kept out of git by convention;
# only docs/superpowers/notes/ is tracked). Silences the `git status` ?? wall.
/.audit*/
/docs/superpowers/plans/
/docs/superpowers/specs/
# Codegen golden-diff drift artifacts (written on a golden mismatch, never committed)
*.actual.*
# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
